706b2d66399f1584cbefe63671/ss_f4ec403a0fac12706b2d66399f1584cbefe63671.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775372631","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/f4ec403a0fac12706b2d66399f1584cbefe63671/ss_f4ec403a0fac12706b2d66399f1584cbefe63671.600x338.jpg?t=1775372631"}],"short_description":"Shoot your way through a corrupted notebook as the hand-drawn stickman named... Stickman! Explore a frame-by-frame animated world, and save it from evil by the power of shooting things in the face in this 2D action platformer.","steam_appid":494240,"support_info":{"email":"roguerelay@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://presskit.playpengame.com/"}